        "tags": [],
        "detail": "The PR is at https://github.com/bobmatnyc/trusty-tools/pull/1114.\n\n---\n\n**Report**\n\n**Worktree path:** `.claude/worktrees/kg-custom` on branch `feat/kg-custom-hybrid`\n\n**How Custom serialization + `from_tag` prefix parsing works:**\n`EdgeKind::tag()` on a `Custom(\"reads_table\")` variant returns `Cow::Owned(\"custom:reads_table\")`. All named variants return `Cow::Borrowed(&'static str)`. `EdgeKind::from_tag(\"custom:reads_table\")` strips the `\"custom:\"` prefix and returns `Some(Custom(\"reads_table\"))`. Bare PascalCase tags that aren't in the exhaustive `from_static_tag` match return `None` — they're never promoted to `Custom`. This is ADR-0010 Option H: only `custom:`-prefixed tags round-trip.\n\n**How Copy removal was handled:**\nRemoved `Copy` from `#[derive(…)]` on `EdgeKind` in `contracts/edge_kind.rs`. Fixed three call sites that relied on implicit copy:\n- `trusty-common/src/symgraph/graph.rs:144` — `*er.weight()` → `er.weight().clone()`\n- `trusty-analyze/src/types/graph.rs:193,196` — `e.kind` in tuple construction → `e.kind.clone()`\n- `trusty-analyze/src/lang/adapters/typescript.rs:393` — `kind: edge_kind` in a loop body → `kind: edge_kind.clone()`\n\nThe BFS comparisons (`== &EdgeKind::CallsFunction`) don't copy — `PartialEq` is reference-based — so those needed no changes.\n\n**`Cow<'static, str>` signature:** `EdgeKind::tag()` returns `Cow<'static, str>`. Named variants use `Cow::Borrowed(self.static_tag())` where `static_tag()` returns `&'static str` via an exhaustive match (panics if called on `Custom`, callers must branch first). `Custom(s)` returns `Cow::Owned(format!(\"custom:{s}\"))`.\n\n**How dropped-unknown edges are counted and surfaced:**\n`SymbolGraph::unknown_edge_tags_dropped: usize` field — incremented in `load_from_corpus` each time `EdgeKind::from_tag` returns `None` for a bare tag. The field is exposed via `pub fn unknown_edge_tags_dropped(&self) -> usize`. `graph_stats_handler` in `status.rs` already included `\"unknown_edge_tags_dropped\": graph.unknown_edge_tags_dropped()` in the `GET /indexes/:id/graph/stats` response.\n\n**`symbol_graph.rs` split:**\nRequired (1754 lines, 2-line headroom). Split into `symbol_graph/`:\n- `mod.rs` (68 lines) — thin facade + `max_kg_nodes` + `ChunkTuple`\n- `graph.rs` (278 lines) — `SymbolGraph` struct + `save_to_corpus` + `load_from_corpus` + all read-only accessors\n- `build.rs` (407 lines) — five build passes\n- `traverse.rs` (192 lines) — BFS engine\n- `tests.rs` (424 lines) — graph structure, BFS, Phase B/C edge tests\n- `persist_tests.rs` (313 lines) — persistence, edge-kind tag round-trip, Custom warm-boot, unknown-tag drop tests\n\n**Doc notes added:**\n- `Writes` variant doc: \"**Provisional/heuristic:** this value was chosen to rank above `Implements` (0.85) per ADR-0010 design intent, but has not yet been validated against pilot data. Subject to downward tuning once real-world corpora are measured.\"\n- `AccessesResource` variant doc: \"**Precedence:** prefer `Reads` or `Writes` when the data-flow direction is known. Use `AccessesResource` only when direction is unknown or ambiguous…\"\n\n**Raw verification output:**\n- `cargo build --workspace`: clean (pnpm warnings for UI builds are pre-existing)\n- `cargo test -p trusty-common --features symgraph`: 73 passed, 6 ignored, 0 failed\n- `cargo test -p trusty-search`: 863 passed, 1 ignored, 0 failed\n- `cargo test -p trusty-analyze`: 423 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`: 0 errors\n- `cargo fmt --check`: no drift\n- `bash scripts/check_line_cap.sh`: 165 grandfathered, 0 violations\n\n**PR URL:** https://github.com/bobmatnyc/trusty-tools/pull/1114",
