        "detail": "<task-notification>\n<task-id>ac633654e055e2ac5<\/task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01Y8sfDHk8UrK8uUtNg4oxbJ<\/tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-masa-Projects-trusty-tools/077cc4c2-20bd-4d8a-9291-03ab8cdbdf33/tasks/ac633654e055e2ac5.output<\/output-file>\n<status>completed<\/status>\n<summary>Agent \"Update-branch, CI, merge PR 1117\" completed<\/summary>\n<result>Perfect! All complete. Let me create a final summary:\n\n## Summary\n\n✅ **PR #1117 successfully brought up to date and squash-merged to main.**\n\n### Update &amp; CI Results\n- **Branch status**: Already up-to-date with main (no merge conflicts, no `.line-cap-allowlist.tsv` reconciliation needed)\n- **All 6 CI checks PASSED** ✓\n  - Format check ✓\n  - Clippy ✓\n  - Test ✓\n  - MSRV check (1.91) ✓\n  - trusty-search daemon smoke test ✓\n  - 500-line file-size cap ✓ (allowlist reconciliation clean)\n\n### Merge Details\n- **Merge commit**: `ab0538c3` (squashed to single conventional commit)\n- **Commit message**: `feat(tga): agentic_mode commit classification + weekly agentic-% metric (closes #1113)`\n- **Admin flag required**: Yes (base branch protection policy required override despite all checks passing)\n- **Branch deletion**: Automatic (PR branch deleted via `--delete-branch`)\n\n### Issue Closure\n- **Issue #1113**: CLOSED (auto-closed by merge)\n- **PR #1117**: MERGED (2026-06-11T16:20:51Z)\n\n### Cleanup\n- **Worktree removed**: `.claude/worktrees/tga-agentic` ✓\n- **Local branch deleted**: `feat/tga-agentic-mode` ✓\n- **kg-ingest worktree preserved**: Active at `.claude/worktrees/kg-ingest` [feat/kg-contrib-ingest] ✓\n- **Main checkout**: Inspection-only, untouched per protocol ✓\n\nAll operations completed successfully. The tga agentic-mode feature is now on main.<\/result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>122243<\/subagent_tokens><tool_uses>35<\/tool_uses><duration_ms>829186<\/duration_ms><\/usage>\n<\/task-notification>",
