        "detail": "Quick update while paused — one of the in-flight items just completed:\n\n✅ **#1117 (tga agentic-mode) merged** to main (`ab0538c3`, `--admin`, all 6 CI checks green); **#1113 closed**, branch was already up-to-date (no allowlist reconciliation needed), `tga-agentic` worktree cleaned up. The `kg-ingest` worktree (#819) is preserved.\n\nSession remains paused (`session-20260611-161949`). Of the three things in flight at pause, **#1117 is now done**; still outstanding for resume:\n- **#819** KG ingest endpoint — still building in `kg-ingest`.\n- **CTO research → \"knowledge\" epic draft** — still running.\n\nI won't start anything new. When you `/mpm-session-resume`, the remaining actions are: review+merge the #819 PR when it lands, and finalize+file the trusty-memory \"knowledge\" epic (dual trusty-memory + trusty-search-KG framing). I'll relay those two results if they arrive before you resume.",
